plan.prompt:
Create a content calendar plan for {brand}.

Brand voice: {brand_voice}
Content themes: {topics}
Target platforms: {platforms}
Number of posts: {num_posts}

For each planned post, specify:
- Post number
- Theme (from the topics list)
- Platform
- Content type (thought leadership, how-to, listicle, case study, hot take, question)
- One-line hook/angle

Distribute themes evenly. Vary content types for engagement. Sequence for narrative momentum.
